{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main.00_01_27_11.Still001.png?t=1743594184\" /><strong>Fart King \u2013 The Ultimate Precision Platforming Challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A determined pug, a legendary crown, and only one way to reach it\u2014by mastering the power of fart propulsion! <i>Fart King</i> is a hardcore platformer where every jump is a test of skill, and every mistake sends you plummeting back down. Can you control your toots well enough to reach the top?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_1.gif?t=1743594184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca8 <strong>High-Stakes Jumping!</strong><br> The only way forward is up, and gravity is your greatest enemy. One wrong move, and you'll face a long, painful fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc36 <strong>Master the Art of the Fart!</strong><br> Every jump demands precision, patience, and nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main.gif?t=1743594184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Plan Every Jump!</strong><br> Not every path is the right one. Think before you leap, because once you're airborne, there's no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A Test of True Endurance!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A deceptively simple but incredibly challenging experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with friends to see who can claim the Fart Crown first!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive gameplay that rewards skill and persistence. <br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_5.gif?t=1743594184\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Practice Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_8.gif?t=1743594184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place checkpoints and respawn instantly to practice tough jumps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_4.gif?t=1743594184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8 Charming pixel-art visuals with smooth animations.<br> \ud83d\udd0a <strong>Choose your fart sounds!</strong> Turn on realistic, juicy fart effects for full immersion, or switch to cute 8-bit sounds if you\u2019d rather not hear toots for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve come this far\u2014will you rise to glory, or will your journey end in a humiliating fall? Only the most skilled players can become the <strong>Fart King!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630870?t=1743594184","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630870?t=1743594184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/bcd73787f60a90e4a2f9f4228319a13c264d2f60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743594184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/bcd73787f60a90e4a2f9f4228319a13c264d2f60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743594184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"b