f?t=1743594184\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Practice Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_8.gif?t=1743594184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place checkpoints and respawn instantly to practice tough jumps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_4.gif?t=1743594184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8 Charming pixel-art visuals with smooth animations.<br> \ud83d\udd0a <strong>Choose your fart sounds!</strong> Turn on realistic, juicy fart effects for full immersion, or switch to cute 8-bit sounds if you\u2019d rather not hear toots for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve come this far\u2014will you rise to glory, or will your journey end in a humiliating fall? Only the most skilled players can become the <strong>Fart King!</strong></p>","developers":["SmoochGM"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/b35b115b69cf4249b360006d8ac6e071e24e00a5/header.jpg?t=1743594184","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120218,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120218/movie480.mp4?t=1743594183","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120218/movie_max.mp4?t=1743594183"},"name":"fart \u043bing